<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank says will release August M3 shortly.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank says will release August M3 shortly.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it would release German M3 money supply data for August shortly.</p>
<p>Economists polled by Reuters on average expect a slowdown in annualised M3 growth to 8.0 percent from 8.6 percent in July. Forecasts range from 7.9 percent to 8.2 percent.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank's target range for 1996 M3 money supply growth is four percent to seven percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
